            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "i tried this for a quick way to make a dessert, wouldnt call this an english triffle since we use fresh friuts and no pre made cream lol, i would call it the american lazy way of making a trifle , tastes good but isnt really a trifle:) my kids loved it :)",
            "datePublished": "2002-01-21T13:24:24.797Z"
